  "Question Type": "text",
  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Question": "Which of the following situations involves drawing balls without replacement?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "Drawing 2 balls simultaneously from a bag.",
    "B": "Drawing 1 ball, recording its color, replacing it, and then drawing another.",
    "C": "Returning the ball to the bag and mixing thoroughly after every draw.",
    "D": "Drawing balls twice in succession, with the same number of balls in the bag before each draw."
  },
  "Correct Answer": "A",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Drawing 2 balls simultaneously is equivalent to drawing the first ball without replacing it before drawing the second. B, C, and D all involve replacement.",
